    "**Two questions, one option set — three times.** PTFL-4.1.3 (#20/#21), PTFL-4.2.1 (#22/#23) and Chapter 1's type questions all reuse an option set. **Do not assume the second answer must be a different letter.**",
    "**The concurrency question tempts you to multiply.** **2000 doctors × 6 updates = 12,000** is offered. **Concurrency counts simultaneous accesses, and each doctor makes one access per hour.** The answer is **2,000**.",
