    "**Baseline** — **a set of metrics used to compare current and previously achieved performance measurements**.",
    "**Transaction** — **activities from the point of initiation to when one or more processes have been completed**.",
    "**Think time** — **delays between user actions**; **response time + think time = elapsed time**.",
    "**Operational profile** — **distinct patterns of interaction with an application**, a **repeatable step-by-step flow for a particular usage**.",
    "**Load profile (scenario)** — **a designated number of instances performing predefined operational profiles over a specified time period**.",
    "**System throughput** — **transactions of a given type per unit of time**; **= [virtual users] / ([processing time] + [think time])**.",
    "**Concurrency** — **the number of simultaneous / parallel threads of execution**.",
    "**Correlation** — **replacing recorded context identifiers with variables extracted from request responses**.",
    "**Parameterization** — **replacing fixed or recorded data with values from a list of possible choices**.",
    "**Service virtualization** — **implementing a stub to replace and emulate an unavailable component**.",
